142
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:58,000
I used taper implants with good initial stability and relatively good stability with adjacent structure.

143
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Grade 5 titanium alloy is used where high strength is required such as narrow implants, superstructure of implants. 

144
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:19,000
And for other parts grade 4 is used which has with proper biocompatibility and strength.

